      "narration": "The table ranges from about half a million parameters to one point five nine two million. CATANet is the smallest entry, followed closely by RFDN and then IMDN. DQ-CTM-SR uses one point one two nine million parameters. That makes it the second largest of these five methods, not the cheapest one.",
